[*][URL="https://github.com/chijure-android-system-development/android_device_lge_g2mv"]Device tree[/URL] (branch cm-11.0). Its README documents every fix and the known issues in detail. Most fixes use LineageOS build flags and overlays; patches/ holds the only two source patches (bionic, LockClock) and a script to apply them.
